{"id":"hazar-enan","name":"Hazar-Enan","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:hazar-enan"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Hazar-enan","text":"Village of fountains, a place on the north-east frontier of Palestine (Num. 34:9, 10). Some have identified it with Ayan ed-Dara in the heart of the central chain of Anti-Libanus. More probably, however, it has been identified with Kuryetein, about 60 miles east-north-east of Damascus. (Comp. Ezek. 47:17; 48:1.)"},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H2704","lemma":"חֲצַר עֵינָן","xlit":"Chătsar ʻÊynân","gloss":"Chatsar-Enan, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Hazar-enan","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H1366","lemma":"גְּבוּל","xlit":"gᵉbûwl","gloss":"a cord","kjv":"border, bound, coast, great","count":4,"share":1},{"strong":"H6828","lemma":"צָפוֹן","xlit":"tsâphôwn","gloss":"hidden","kjv":"north","count":3,"share":0.75},{"strong":"H2574","lemma":"חֲמָת","xlit":"Chămâth","gloss":"Chamath, a place in Syria","kjv":"Hamath, Hemath","count":2,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H1834","lemma":"דַּמֶּשֶׂק","xlit":"Dammeseq","gloss":"Damascus, a city of Syria","kjv":"Damascus","count":2,"share":0.5},{"strong":"H6285","lemma":"פֵּאָה","xlit":"pêʼâh","gloss":"mouth in a figurative sense","kjv":"corner, end, quarter, side","count":2,"share":0.5}],"verses":["Num.34.9","Num.34.10","Ezek.48.1","Ezek.47.17"],"related":[{"id":"canaan","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"chesulloth","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"chisloth-tabor","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"holy-land","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"judah-the-tribe-of","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"},{"id":"landmarks","type":"lexical","strong":"H1366","why":"both lead with גְּבוּל (H1366)"}],"works":[]}
